<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia posts $764.6 mln Nov trade surplus.</title>
<headline>Indonesia posts $764.6 mln Nov trade surplus.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia posted a trade surplus of $764.6 million last November, compared with $995.7 million in October, Information Minister Harmoko said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Following are the trade figures for November, in millions of dollars, with comparisons for the previous month and a year earlier:</p>
<p>				November    October    November 95</p>
<p>    Trade balance	  +764.6     +995.7	+633.8</p>
<p>    Exports		 4,409.1    4,463.66    3,987.9</p>
<p>    Imports		 3,644.5    3,468.00    3,354.1</p>
<p>    Oil/gas exports     1,062.8    1,132.43	864.3</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
